- Team ID
    GetGut@AAU

- Task ID
    6.1.1

- Run ID
    1

- Type of training applied
    Finetuned model from a base GLiNER architecture on biomedical entity recognition tasks as described in the scripts of this repository.

- Pre-processing methods
    Sliding windows with overlap 
    Character offset pre-calculation. 
    Processing at the section level (title and abstract) with entity position tracking relative to the original document.

- Training data used
    Gold, silver, silver2025 and bronze

- Relevant details of the run
    - Base Model: GLiNER (pretrained finetuned model)
  
- A link to a GitHub repository enabling easy reproducibility of the run:
    https://github.com/SophusJ/GetGut-AAU
  
